# Slash commands

Agents execute catalog slashes through the `spotify-rip` MCP server.
Do **not** run `/command` in the Shell.

## Primary surface

- `/read <sub>` — inspect (read-only tools). Bare `/read` loads `.agent-context/read.md`.
- `/do <sub>` — mutate. Bare `/do` lists subcommands.

`/read help` and `/do help` list every subcommand.

Inspect subs: `status`, `health`, `index`, `hub`, `ana-chi`, `graph`, `clean`, `nest`, `track`, `traverse`, `vault`, `watchdog`, `hooks`, `queue`, `commands`, `cairrn`, `css`, `m3`, `temporal`, `vector`, `temporal-coherence`, `phi`, `shuffle`, `bus`, `poll`, `forecast`, `coherence`, `psspps`, `find`, `audit`, `context`

Mutate subs: `sim`, `neg-exp`, `sweep`, `langevin`, `mfpt`, `ana-chi`, `propagate`, `inject`, `reset`, `hub-inject`, `set-goal`, `clear-goal`, `commit`, `link`, `topo`, `cairrn-topo`, `ingest`, `ingest-source`, `sync`, `track-sync`, `annotate`, `test`, `cairrn`, `batch`, `k`, `record`, `advance`, `temporal-reset`, `enqueue`, `step`, `flush`, `clip`, `seed`, `shuffle-step`, `next`, `submit`, `wait`, `restart`, `10`

## Preferred dispatch

Call MCP `run_command` with the raw slash string (including `/read` / `/do` form).
Legacy one-shot slashes still parse as aliases.

## Workflow modes

`/talk`, `/explain`, `/dev`, `/modular`, `/wire`, `/edit`, `/clean`, `/audit`, `/read`

Read the matching `.agent-context/<slash>.md` immediately and follow it.

